---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="About Us | Unicode To Non-Unicode Converter"
	description="Learn about UnicodeToNonUnicode.com, our mission to simplify Indic DTP font conversion for translators, graphic designers, and publishers with 100% client-side privacy."
	keywords="about unicode to non unicode, indic dtp converter, telugu font conversion team, client side font converter"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-4 sm:py-8">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<div class="border-b border-[var(--hairline)] pb-6 space-y-3">
			<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--hairline)] text-[var(--ink-secondary)] font-semibold inline-block uppercase tracking-wider">
				About Our Platform
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)]">
				About Unicode To Non-Unicode Converter
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
				Empowering desktop publishers, typists, translators, and graphic designers across India with fast, privacy-first font transliteration.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Content Grid -->
		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
			<!-- Section 1: Our Mission -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Our Mission</h2>
				<p>
					In modern computing, web content, mobile apps, and digital documents use the universal <strong>Unicode standard (UTF-8)</strong>. However, legacy publishing tools like older versions of Adobe Photoshop, Adobe InDesign CS6, CorelDRAW, PageMaker, and MS Word rely heavily on 8-bit ASCII character maps known as <strong>Non-Unicode fonts</strong>.
				</p>
				<p>
					Pasting modern web text directly into these legacy design tools results in broken text boxes, corrupted glyphs, or unreadable symbols. Our mission at <strong>UnicodeToNonUnicode.com</strong> is to eliminate this friction by providing an instant, 100% browser-based conversion engine that translates modern Indic Unicode text into legacy font encodings with perfect typographic fidelity.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2: Supported Languages & Encodings -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
				<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
					<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Supported Languages & Fonts</h3>
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<li><strong>Telugu:</strong> Anu 6, Anu 7 (Anu Unicode), Shree-Lipi Telugu, Apple Telugu</li>
						<li><strong>Hindi:</strong> Kruti Dev 010, Shree-Lipi Hindi, Devlys</li>
						<li><strong>Tamil:</strong> Bamini Tamil ASCII</li>
						<li><strong>Malayalam:</strong> C-DAC ISM Revathi Malayalam</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
					<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Key Engineering Highlights</h3>
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<li><strong>100% Client-Side Privacy:</strong> Zero server uploads or text logging.</li>
						<li><strong>Adobe & Word Sanitizer:</strong> Automatically strips ZWJ/ZWNJ markers that corrupt Photoshop.</li>
						<li><strong>Bidirectional Conversion:</strong> Converts both Unicode-to-Legacy and Legacy-to-Unicode.</li>
						<li><strong>DTP Controls:</strong> Toggles for Alt Raa Vatthu (ర వత్తు), digit conversion, and space cleaning.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3: Privacy & Security Commitment -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">100% Privacy Commitment</h2>
				<p>
					We understand that translators and publication houses work with confidential manuscripts, news reports, and legal documents. Unlike other web tools that send text to remote backend servers, <strong>UnicodeToNonUnicode.com processes 100% of your data inside your web browser</strong> using WebAssembly and client-side JavaScript. Your text never leaves your device.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
